],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Face of Another includes unsettling themes like social media addiction, cyberbullying, and identity distortion, presented through eerie visuals, distorted faces, and symbolic environments. While there is no explicit sexual content, some scenes explore self-destructive thoughts and psychological distress, which may not be suitable for younger players or those sensitive to such topics."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face of Another</strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience where a mysterious entity traps you inside a warped digital nightmare. In a world where technology distorts reality, your only lifeline is your phone. Use it to capture clues, solve puzzles, and survive the horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272170/extras/4d8988943c5f897685801770a9b248d8.poster.avif?t=1756053573\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272170/extras/4d8988943c5f897685801770a9b248d8.webm?t=1756053573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272170/extras/4d8988943c5f897685801770a9b248d8.mp4?t=1756053573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a smartphone (Take photos, solve puzzles and more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark story about bullying, social media, toxic comparisons, and a vengeful entity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime 60 - 90 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 7 different phone cases</p><p class=\"